            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Deb C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The chocolate flavor of the Ghiradelli chocolate chips I used produced a great deep, rich chocolate flavor, however I was disappointed that the Irish Cream flavor was negligible. The truffles were smooth and yummy and everyone enjoyed them."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Laurie McCrary Jameson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The only reason II gave this 4 stars is because I needed to add more Irish Cream. The flavor (using this recipe) is too faint. Other than that, it was delicious. All my giftees loved it.",
            "datePublished": "2019-02-15T03:01:03.387Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
