            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MISS BITCH"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I tried it today. And as Darlene has said, I had a real hard time getting it to set and shaping. Also the the irish creme got lost in the chocolate. Was not able to tell the ingredient was in there. I too will make it again maybe but will have to experiment with some miner changes as to cut down on the cream and adding some extra liqueur",
            "datePublished": "2017-03-09T00:31:26.240Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Darlene"
            },
            "reviewBody": "They taste very good but they didn't set up very well and we had a hard time shaping them into little balls. I think I would make them again but would put them in the freezer for a bit longer before I tried to shape them.",
